  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ResetOtherScript(ScriptName: string)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llResetOtherScript(string ScriptName);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Resets script <b>name</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>ScriptName / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
          <td>a script in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim_inventory</li>
        <li>script</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">249</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>On script reset...</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The current event/function is exited without further execution or return.</li>
    <li>All global variables are set to their defaults</li>
    <li>The event queue is cleared, and recurring events are stopped.</li>
    <li>The <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Default" target="_blank">default</a> state is set as the active state
    <ul>
      <li>If it has a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/State_entry" target="_blank">state_entry</a> event, then it is queued.</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>name</b> is missing from the prim&#39;s inventory or it is not a script then an error is shouted on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/DEBUG_CHANNEL" target="_blank">DEBUG_CHANNEL</a>.</li>
    <li>If the script is not running, this call has no effect, even after the script is set running again.</li>
    <li>A script can reset itself with this function (not just other scripts).</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

-- the other script must be within the same prim and has to be running

function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local num_detected = #events
    ll.ResetTime()
end

function LLEvents.touch_end(events)
    local num_detected = #events
    if ll.GetTime() < 3.0 then
        ll.Say(0, "Please click & hold for at least 3.0 seconds.")
    else
        ll.ResetOtherScript("second")
    end
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`// the other script must be within the same prim and has to be running

default
{
    touch_start(integer num_detected)
    {
        llResetTime();
    }

    touch_end(integer num_detected)
    {
        if (llGetTime() < 3.0)
            llSay(0, "Please click & hold for at least 3.0 seconds.");
        else
            llResetOtherScript("second");
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
